{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9KInKoRlCvkTaa843gBmDQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:23.683937+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9KInKoRlCvkTaa843gBmDQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSCbqiasHjQqic22DU7QicaMNuzHBnHdFjWXIFx77gkxAWhWH5dibMo3aMRw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><em><span>简介</span></em></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>｜土木工程学科</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>上海理工大学于1996年创办土木工程系，并开始招收土木工程专业本科生和研究生，拥有能源与环境工程博士学位授予权、土木工程一级学科（下设桥梁与隧道工程、岩土工程、结构工程、防灾减灾工程及防护工程等二级学科点）硕士学位授予权和土木水利专业硕士学位授予权。每年招收本科生100余名、硕士研究生80余名。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSjQ7czJ0jHBg4cDPFqvyEaPFaBd0kFz2TbftsWibP5mdDDDJ9sULU7Gw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSCbqiasHjQqic22DU7QicaMNuzHBnHdFjWXIFx77gkxAWhWH5dibMo3aMRw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><em><span>简介</span></em></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>｜师资力量</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>现有专任教师38人，其中教授7人，副教授13人，具有博士学位的教师（含在读博士）占教师总数的92%。近五年获省部级科研奖项20项，承担国家重点研发计划子课题、国家自然科学基金等纵、横向项目260项，总经费达6179万元，省部级以上的研发中心和实验室5项。发表论文达795篇，其中SCI/EI论文达171篇；授权专利达112项，其中发明专利达98项。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSCbqiasHjQqic22DU7QicaMNuzHBnHdFjWXIFx77gkxAWhWH5dibMo3aMRw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><em><span>简介</span></em></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>｜学科建设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我校土木工程学科在上海市属高校中最早拥有土木工程一级学科硕士点，是上海高校中唯一设立了土木工程全部二级学科的学院。在学校和学院的长期支持下，土木工程学科在人才培养、科学研究、学科建设等多个层面都取得了较好发展。学科拥有全国优秀教师、上海市教学名师、上海市育才奖、上海市领军人才(海外）、上海市浦江学者、上海市东方学者、上海市青年东方学者、上海市启明星计划、上海市青年科技英才扬帆计划、欧盟“玛丽•居里”学者等20名高层次人才。2022年荣获上海市教学成果二等奖2项，同年，土木工程专业获评上海市一流本科专业。2024年获上海市科技进步奖二等奖。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSYWA8seP1S102hVZQE8zImTsaJ1Pt2SV0TsibiaKib3YeajLOfic745JKqw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSCbqiasHjQqic22DU7QicaMNuzHBnHdFjWXIFx77gkxAWhWH5dibMo3aMRw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><em><span>简介</span></em></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>｜人才培养</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学院人才培养聚焦国际前沿方向，把握国家重大发展战略需求，致力于培养有较强科研能力、勇于创新和探索、具有国际化视野的高级人才。</span><span><span>在特大型城市基础设施建设和节能减排需求、实现建筑制造节能一体化、既有公共建筑加固与节能改造、历史建筑风貌保护、超高性能预制装配式构件研发等方面取得了技术突破与创新，深度参与了我国城市基础设施大规模建设和快速更新的实践，取得了重大社会效益和经济效益，所培养的人才社会认可度较高。每年邀请国外专家学者为本系研究生授课，并有多名研究生被推荐去往国际知名高校进行联合培养。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSlGpKXibGXyWBk2yjXBDWk6LicDB5JIiaUXZ8VAqB65cvGdjerHrYqEatQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人才培养</span></strong></p><p><span>talent cultivation</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjS1MojSjicV1ytJ8HRH4kRK1Ou6tBvaphakcTAsL6cs9J6Wt5tPouZibJg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSj4LepibGa3tcoexexJqVdtQfpJniaq6xBzo6FTPuc2X6amR982DYJS1Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>欢迎有志读研的优秀学生</span></p><p><span>报考我校研究生</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSrlRKOEHxu09mtoKdYVHnJX8Uvr2NicG0EvunzkLXF1rF1r3BVk4AG7Q/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSdLUs1Vn3k5rSIYGicPgDquibtkRgSwvhW6ribWicAB8upEn54zqeoqArPw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>｜</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>活动时间</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>｜7月3日（周四）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2025年土木工程系暑期夏令营内容与安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>2025· AGENDA</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSPBTX6xPQOUZEvstX4jE9j5w9ib2MBy47jnhM25zEib3Zvtfb4YdghswA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名时间</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>｜6月22日-7月1日</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>7月2日学院审核报名学生材料，并在学院网站</span><span><span>(http://sea.usst.edu.cn)公示入选营员名单。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSCbqiasHjQqic22DU7QicaMNuzHBnHdFjWXIFx77gkxAWhWH5dibMo3aMRw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>活动方式</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>｜线下+线上（腾讯会议）</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>本校学生要求到现场参加活动，其他高校学生可以选择线下，也可以选择线上参与活动，线上开展通过腾讯会议进行，请提前备好会议虚拟背景。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSCbqiasHjQqic22DU7QicaMNuzHBnHdFjWXIFx77gkxAWhWH5dibMo3aMRw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>优秀营员</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>｜50%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为鼓励和肯定学生参与本次夏令营活动，也为2026年学院研究生招生进行宣传和预热，将遴选出1/2比例的营员作为本次优秀营员。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSCbqiasHjQqic22DU7QicaMNuzHBnHdFjWXIFx77gkxAWhWH5dibMo3aMRw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>｜线上文档</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人员请于</span><strong><span><span>2025年7月1日（周二）24:00前</span></span></strong><span>打开并填写《2025年上海理工大学环境与建筑学院土木工程系全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》，备注好相关证明材料。并将相关附件发送至邮箱：</span><span><strong><span>wangsuran@usst.edu.cn</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>邮件主题请按“姓名-所在学校-电话-（线上或线下参加）”形式命名</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>压缩包内单个证明材料命名为“所在学校-姓名-材料名称”</span></strong></span></p><p><span>报名表格链接↓</span></p><p><span>【腾讯文档】2025年上理环建学院·土木工程系·全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表</span></p><p><span>https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DR1JzVHRIV2RkV1Z3</span></p><p><span><span>报名表格二维码↓</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjShyLibaIJBib3eNP6ErwZbNfSbvL7OCAQiaibkMTbOoWpA9GCdoHibzHHm8A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSCbqiasHjQqic22DU7QicaMNuzHBnHdFjWXIFx77gkxAWhWH5dibMo3aMRw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><i><span>微信交流群</span></i></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>｜扫码加入</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>请报名的学生扫码加入2025年上海理工大学环境与建筑学院</span><strong><span>土木工程系</span></strong><span>全国优秀大学生夏令营微信群</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>请务必填写文档报名后再申请入群。申请人入群后请注明“姓名+本科学校”，方便工作人员核对信息。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/0yYJvxMcvMaPo4zcYu5icF5ibf4gYIXIjSbmyLINmrOgTQueib0qrhAxS8Ao2CVibNuNw9ckgpccG7pE9IXVaZpEjg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>注：若微信二维码失效，请将微信号发送邮件至上述邮箱。</span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"090c7f4e710ba17da68c31ce30eca87ed24e0b1f9948f57c31e3119caed63296","textLength":1585,"sourceSha256":"1f4301aee98891403c0dea7db605bd149b229c26dc3ec3679cb03768c3d67d8f","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c270a351494b529b7a83","title":"2025年上海理工大学环境与建筑学院土木工程系 2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:23.683937+00:00"}
